{% liquid
  assign heading_tag = 'h2'
  if request.page_type == 'page'
    assign heading_tag = 'h1'
  endif
%}
<section class="about-rizo about-rizo--{{ section.settings.theme }}" id="RizoOriginFile">
  <div class="page-width">{% if settings.heritage_mode %}{% render 'rizo-dateline', label: section.settings.dateline_label %}{% endif %}</div>
  <div class="page-width about-rizo-grid">
    <div class="about-rizo-lead">
      {% if section.settings.eyebrow != blank %}<p class="eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow }}</p>{% endif %}
      <{{ heading_tag }}>{{ section.settings.heading }}</{{ heading_tag }}>
      {% if section.settings.body != blank %}<div class="rte about-rizo-body">{{ section.settings.body }}</div>{% endif %}
      {% if section.settings.quote != blank %}
        <blockquote class="about-founder-quote">
          <p>{{ section.settings.quote }}</p>
          {% if section.settings.quote_attribution != blank %}<cite>{{ section.settings.quote_attribution }}</cite>{% endif %}
        </blockquote>
      {% endif %}
      {% if section.settings.link_label != blank and section.settings.link != blank %}
        <a class="text-arrow" href="{{ section.settings.link }}">{{ section.settings.link_label }} {% render 'icon', name: 'arrow' %}</a>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="about-rizo-points">
      {% for block in section.blocks %}
        <article class="about-point" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
          <span class="about-point-number">0{{ forloop.index }}</span>
          <div>
            <h3>{{ block.settings.title }}</h3>
            <p>{{ block.settings.text }}</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>

  {% if section.settings.show_origin_art %}
    <div class="page-width about-origin-archive" role="region" aria-label="Evolution of the Rizo character">
      <header>
        <p class="eyebrow">ORIGIN ARTIFACTS</p>
        <h3>THE MARK GREW THE SAME WAY THE WORLD DID.</h3>
        <p>It began as a drawing made with what was available. The shape changed, the line got clearer, and the feeling stayed intact.</p>
      </header>
      <div class="about-origin-grid">
        <figure class="about-origin-card about-origin-card--sketch">
          <img src="{{ 'rizo-origin-sketch.webp' | asset_url }}" width="1152" height="1536" loading="lazy" alt="The original pencil drawing of the Rizo flame character">
          <figcaption><span>01 / FIRST DRAWING</span>BEFORE THE WORLD HAD A SYSTEM.</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="about-origin-card about-origin-card--face">
          <img src="{{ 'rizo-face-basic.png' | asset_url }}" width="800" height="800" loading="lazy" alt="An early simplified Rizo face with round eyes and stitched X marks">
          <figcaption><span>02 / BASIC SIGNAL</span>THE EXPRESSION CAME BEFORE THE POLISH.</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="about-origin-card about-origin-card--mark">
          <img src="{{ 'rizo-origin-mark.png' | asset_url }}" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy" alt="The current blue and white Rizo flame mark">
          <figcaption><span>03 / CURRENT MARK</span>THE FLAME FOUND ITS FORM.</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  {% endif %}

  <div class="pittsburgh-line" aria-hidden="true">412 · BUILT THROUGH LIMITS · RIZO · PITTSBURGH ·</div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name":"About Rizo",
  "class":"section-about-rizo",
  "max_blocks":6,
  "settings":[
    {"type":"text","id":"dateline_label","label":"Fileline label","default":"RIZO STORY / ORIGIN FILE"},
    {"type":"text","id":"eyebrow","label":"Eyebrow","default":"ORIGIN FILE / RIZO WORLD"},
    {"type":"text","id":"heading","label":"Heading","default":"BUILT WITHOUT A BLUEPRINT."},
    {"type":"richtext","id":"body","label":"Story","default":"<p>Rizo did not begin with unlimited resources, industry connections, or a perfect plan. It began with Taymar Spencer wanting a real way to express himself—and refusing to let limitations decide what he could create.</p><p>Taymar learned by making, experimenting, rebuilding, and accepting help from people who believed in the vision. He continues to develop the designs and make the clothes himself.</p><p>Seeing people receive a piece, put it on, and feel something real turned the work into a passion. What began as one person’s outlet became a mission to give other people room to express themselves.</p><p>The goal is bigger than garments. It is to create something that moves people and use that energy to change the world around it.</p>"},
    {"type":"textarea","id":"quote","label":"Founder quote","default":"Rizo started through limitations. I was in a box, and I broke out."},
    {"type":"text","id":"quote_attribution","label":"Quote attribution","default":"TAYMAR SPENCER / FOUNDER & BRAND OWNER"},
    {"type":"checkbox","id":"show_origin_art","label":"Show the original sketch and logo evolution","default":true},
    {"type":"text","id":"link_label","label":"Link label"},
    {"type":"url","id":"link","label":"Link"},
    {"type":"select","id":"theme","label":"Color theme","default":"paper","options":[{"value":"paper","label":"Paper"},{"value":"dark","label":"Dark"}]}
  ],
  "blocks":[
    {
      "type":"point",
      "name":"Story point",
      "settings":[
        {"type":"text","id":"title","label":"Title","default":"LIMITATIONS WERE THE FIRST MATERIAL"},
        {"type":"textarea","id":"text","label":"Text","default":"The lack of a perfect setup forced Rizo to invent its own process, language and way forward."}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets":[
    {
      "name":"About Rizo",
      "blocks":[
        {"type":"point","settings":{"title":"LIMITATIONS WERE THE FIRST MATERIAL","text":"The lack of a perfect setup forced Rizo to invent its own process, language and way forward."}},
        {"type":"point","settings":{"title":"FOUNDER-LED FROM IDEA TO GARMENT","text":"Taymar develops the designs and makes the clothes himself, keeping the work close to the original intent."}},
        {"type":"point","settings":{"title":"CREATIVITY NEEDS AN OUTLET","text":"Rizo exists to help people show more of who they are, not disappear into what everyone else is wearing."}},
        {"type":"point","settings":{"title":"HELP MATTERED ALONG THE WAY","text":"Friends, supporters and people who showed up helped the world move forward before there were formal titles."}},
        {"type":"point","settings":{"title":"STILL BECOMING","text":"Growth is not hidden behind a polished story. Learning, rebuilding and getting better are part of the design."}}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
